---
description: Default to brief replies — simple, concise, no walls of text
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the **brief** skill (`~/.agents/skills/brief/SKILL.md`) in every reply unless the user explicitly asks for depth (long write-up, tutorial, full spec, etc.).

- Simple, concise prose; no walls of text.
- Lead with the answer or outcome; trim repetition and filler.
- Use lists or short sections when there are several points; skip optional follow-ups unless they unblock the task.

When the user invokes `/brief`, tighten further — fewer words, same facts.
